Stepper Motion Workbench
========================

The motion library, Arduino examples, and host test sources were adapted
from FastAccelStepper by Jochen Kiemes and contributors.
Source: https://github.com/gin66/FastAccelStepper
Imported commit: 8e55103cf1af98d89be1710ee220844c0cd178f4
Copyright (c) 2020 J.Kiemes
License: MIT (see LICENSE for the full terms)

The original project credits the following contributions:

- ixil: ATmega2560 support
- gagank1: ESP-IDF integration
- clazarowitz: Atmel SAM Due port
- HeldeReis: ESP32-S3 port
- DaAwesomeP: ATmega168/168P/328 support
- turley: stepper count initialization
- GarmischWg: ESP32-S3 RMT support
- SHWotever: AVR direction pin handling
- HalfVoxel: documentation and preprocessor fixes
- pvginkel: engine initialization race fix
- freelancer1845: ESP-IDF integration documentation
- viteo: pulse counter direction pin support
- Magnus: Pico SDK support and implementation suggestions
- Sam W: SAM3X queue allocation fix
- drayde: ESP-IDF 6 RMT header fix
- Loriland: Microchip SAMD51 port
- seifemad (ARDUTECH0): experimental Teensy 4.0/4.1 port and bring-up

The Teensy 4.x backend adapts QuadTimer register sequencing from TMR.h
and dynamic-pin GPIO handling from stepperbase.h/.cpp in TeensyStep4.
Source: https://github.com/luni64/TeensyStep4
